WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Changing styles
Play your song in another style, and choose whose tempo it plays at.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.960
1. Loop the song
Turn KNOB 4 (At end) to "again". Press PLAY, and the song plays over and over.

3
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:18.620
2. Change the style
Press HOME for the Home page. Turn KNOB 1 (Style) to Rock.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:27.620
2. Change the style
The song keeps its sections and chords, but now it has Rock's band and tempo.

5
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:34.220
3. Set your own tempo
Turn KNOB 2 (Tempo) to 90.

6
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:42.800
3. Set your own tempo
Turn KNOB 1 back to Funk. Funk's band comes in, but your tempo stays at 90.

7
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:51.060
4. Use the style's tempo
Press SEL, and the list opens on STYLE TEMPO 100. Press SEL again to use it.

8
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:57.640
4. Use the style's tempo
From now on, each style brings its own tempo again. Turn KNOB 1 to Pop, and the tempo goes to 105.

9
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.520
4. Use the style's tempo
Press PLAY to stop.

10
00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:05.600
Next: 105
Recording a melody.
